<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<pipeline>
  <info>
    <name>silver_comentarios</name>
    <name_sync_with_filename>Y</name_sync_with_filename>
    <description>Padroniza bronze.comentarios, remove duplicidade por (usuario_id, conteudo_id, data), valida referencia contra silver.catalogo e regras de negocio, e separa aprovados (silver.comentarios) de rejeitados (quarentena.comentarios). RF21.</description>
    <extended_description/>
    <pipeline_version/>
    <pipeline_type>Normal</pipeline_type>
    <parameters></parameters>
    <capture_transform_performance>N</capture_transform_performance>
    <transform_performance_capturing_delay>1000</transform_performance_capturing_delay>
    <transform_performance_capturing_size_limit>100</transform_performance_capturing_size_limit>
    <created_user>-</created_user>
    <created_date>2026/09/26 00:00:00.000</created_date>
    <modified_user>-</modified_user>
    <modified_date>2026/09/27 00:00:00.000</modified_date>
  </info>
  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>Estudante 1 - Silver
Regras: usuario_id e conteudo_id obrigatorios; conteudo_id precisa
existir em silver.catalogo; avaliacao (se preenchida) entre 1 e 5;
data obrigatoria.
Dedup por (usuario_id, conteudo_id, data).

CORRECOES (27/09/2026):
1) "Ler bronze.comentarios": bronze.comentarios nao tem colunas soltas
   usuario_id/conteudo_id/avaliacao/comentario/data - tudo vem dentro
   de conteudo_json (jsonb, chave ""). A query original selecionava
   colunas inexistentes e falhava com "column does not exist". Query
   corrigida para extrair via conteudo_json -&gt; '' -&gt; 0 -&gt;&gt; 'campo',
   no mesmo padrao usado em bronze.interacoes.
2) "Validar conteudo existe" (DBLookup): a coluna de origem em
   silver.catalogo se chama "titulo", nao "titulo_ref" (que e so o
   alias local). Estava configurado com &lt;name&gt;titulo_ref&lt;/name&gt;,
   o que causaria "column titulo_ref does not exist" em
   silver.catalogo. Corrigido para &lt;name&gt;titulo&lt;/name&gt; com
   &lt;rename&gt;titulo_ref&lt;/rename&gt;.
3) "Validar regras" e "Preparar quarentena" usavam o plugin
   UserDefinedJavaExpression, que nao esta instalado neste ambiente
   ("Can't run pipeline due to plugin missing"). Convertidos para
   ScriptValueMod (JavaScript/Rhino), igual ao padrao ja usado e
   testado em silver_interacoes. data_erro construido como
   java.sql.Timestamp diretamente, evitando o problema de NativeDate
   ja corrigido naquele outro pipeline.
4) "Padronizar tipos" (SelectValues): meta/remove precisam ficar
   DENTRO de &lt;fields&gt;, nao como irmaos - senao o Hop acusa "At
   least one of select, remove or meta screens should contain data".
5) "Validar conteudo existe" (DBLookup): &lt;schema&gt; e &lt;table&gt;
   estavam como filhos diretos de &lt;transform&gt;, mas o parser do
   Hop exige que fiquem DENTRO de &lt;lookup&gt;. Com isso fora do
   lugar, a query gerada ficava "SELECT * FROM null limit 1".
   Corrigido movendo schema/table para dentro de &lt;lookup&gt;.
6) "Validar regras": faltava validar o FORMATO da data. Valores como
   "2026-99-99" passavam pela regra (que so checava data vazia) e
   quebravam depois em "Padronizar tipos" ao converter para Date
   ("couldn't convert string to a date"). Adicionada checagem via
   regex (ano-mes-dia com mes 01-12 e dia 01-31) antes de aprovar;
   nota: nao valida dias por mes especifico (ex: 30/02 passa), mas
   cobre o caso reportado.</note>
      <xloc>32</xloc><yloc>16</yloc><width>340</width><height>-1</height>
    </notepad>
  </notepads>
  <order>
    <hop><from>Ler bronze.comentarios</from><to>Remover duplicados</to><enabled>Y</enabled></hop>
    <hop><from>Remover duplicados</from><to>Validar conteudo existe</to><enabled>Y</enabled></hop>
    <hop><from>Validar conteudo existe</from><to>Validar regras</to><enabled>Y</enabled></hop>
    <hop><from>Validar regras</from><to>Aprovado?</to><enabled>Y</enabled></hop>
    <hop><from>Aprovado?</from><to>Padronizar tipos</to><enabled>Y</enabled></hop>
    <hop><from>Aprovado?</from><to>Preparar quarentena</to><enabled>Y</enabled></hop>
    <hop><from>Padronizar tipos</from><to>Gravar silver.comentarios</to><enabled>Y</enabled></hop>
    <hop><from>Preparar quarentena</from><to>Selecionar campos quarentena</to><enabled>Y</enabled></hop>
    <hop><from>Selecionar campos quarentena</from><to>Gravar quarentena.comentarios</to><enabled>Y</enabled></hop>
  </order>

  <transform>
    <name>Ler bronze.comentarios</name>
    <type>TableInput</type>
    <description>Extrai os campos de dentro do JSONB (conteudo_json), pois bronze.comentarios nao possui colunas soltas para usuario_id/conteudo_id/avaliacao/comentario/data.</description>
    <distribute>Y</distribute>
    <copies>1</copies>
    <partitioning><method>none</method><schema_name/></partitioning>
    <connection>pg_desafio2</connection>
    <sql>SELECT 
       (conteudo_json -> '' -> 0 ->> 'usuario_id') AS usuario_id, 
       (conteudo_json -> '' -> 0 ->> 'conteudo_id') AS conteudo_id, 
       (conteudo_json -> '' -> 0 ->> 'avaliacao') AS avaliacao, 
       (conteudo_json -> '' -> 0 ->> 'comentario') AS comentario, 
       (conteudo_json -> '' -> 0 ->> 'data') AS data, 
       execucao_id
FROM bronze.comentarios
WHERE execucao_id = '${EXECUCAO_ID}'</sql>
    <limit>0</limit>
    <lookup/>
    <execute_each_row>N</execute_each_row>
    <variables_active>Y</variables_active>
    <lazy_conversion_active>N</lazy_conversion_active>
    <attributes/>
    <GUI><xloc>112</xloc><yloc>128</yloc><draw>Y</draw></GUI>
  </transform>

  <transform>
    <name>Remover duplicados</name>
    <type>UniqueRowsByHashSet</type>
    <description>Dedup por chave de negocio, sem precisar de sort previo.</description>
    <distribute>Y</distribute>
    <copies>1</copies>
    <partitioning><method>none</method><schema_name/></partitioning>
    <count_rows>N</count_rows>
    <count_field/>
    <reject_duplicate_row>N</reject_duplicate_row>
    <error_description/>
    <fields>
      <field><name>usuario_id</name></field>
      <field><name>conteudo_id</name></field>
      <field><name>data</name></field>
    </fields>
    <attributes/>
    <GUI><xloc>288</xloc><yloc>128</yloc><draw>Y</draw></GUI>
  </transform>

  <transform>
    <name>Validar conteudo existe</name>
    <type>DBLookup</type>
    <description>Verifica se conteudo_id existe em silver.catalogo (RF21 - integridade referencial).</description>
    <distribute>Y</distribute>
    <copies>1</copies>
    <partitioning><method>none</method><schema_name/></partitioning>
    <connection>pg_desafio2</connection>
    <cache>N</cache>
    <cache_load_all>N</cache_load_all>
    <cache_size>0</cache_size>
    <lookup>
      <schema>silver</schema>
      <table>catalogo</table>
      <key>
        <name>conteudo_id</name>
        <name2/>
        <condition>=</condition>
        <field>conteudo_id</field>
      </key>
      <value>
        <name>titulo</name>
        <rename>titulo_ref</rename>
        <default/>
        <type>String</type>
        <trim_type>none</trim_type>
      </value>
      <orderby/>
      <fail_on_multiple>N</fail_on_multiple>
      <eat_row_on_failure>N</eat_row_on_failure>
    </lookup>
    <attributes/>
    <GUI><xloc>464</xloc><yloc>128</yloc><draw>Y</draw></GUI>
  </transform>

  <transform>
    <name>Validar regras</name>
    <type>ScriptValueMod</type>
    <description>Calcula regra_violada (NULL = aprovado) via Javascript, substituindo plugin UserDefinedJavaExpression faltante.</description>
    <distribute>Y</distribute>
    <copies>1</copies>
    <partitioning><method>none</method><schema_name/></partitioning>
    <jsScripts>
      <jsScript>
        <jsScript_type>0</jsScript_type>
        <jsScript_name>Script 1</jsScript_name>
        <jsScript_script>
var regra_violada = null;

var u_id = (usuario_id != null) ? usuario_id.toString().trim() : "";
var c_id = (conteudo_id != null) ? conteudo_id.toString().trim() : "";
var dt = (data != null) ? data.toString().trim() : "";
var av = (avaliacao != null) ? avaliacao.toString().trim() : "";

if (u_id == "") {
    regra_violada = "usuario_id ausente";
} else if (c_id == "") {
    regra_violada = "conteudo_id ausente";
} else if (titulo_ref == null) {
    regra_violada = "conteudo_id inexistente no catalogo";
} else if (dt == "") {
    regra_violada = "data ausente";
} else if (!dt.match(/^\d{4}-(0[1-9]|1[0-2])-(0[1-9]|[12]\d|3[01])$/)) {
    regra_violada = "data invalida";
} else if (av != "" &amp;&amp; !av.match(/^[1-5]$/)) {
    regra_violada = "avaliacao invalida";
}
        </jsScript_script>
      </jsScript>
    </jsScripts>
    <fields>
      <field>
        <name>regra_violada</name>
        <rename>regra_violada</rename>
        <type>String</type>
        <length>-1</length>
        <precision>-1</precision>
        <replace>N</replace>
      </field>
    </fields>
    <optimizationLevel>9</optimizationLevel>
    <languageVersion>ES6</languageVersion>
    <attributes/>
    <GUI><xloc>640</xloc><yloc>128</yloc><draw>Y</draw></GUI>
  </transform>

  <transform>
    <name>Aprovado?</name>
    <type>FilterRows</type>
    <description/>
    <distribute>Y</distribute>
    <copies>1</copies>
    <partitioning><method>none</method><schema_name/></partitioning>
    <send_true_to>Padronizar tipos</send_true_to>
    <send_false_to>Preparar quarentena</send_false_to>
    <compare>
      <condition><negated>N</negated><leftvalue>regra_violada</leftvalue><function>IS NULL</function></condition>
    </compare>
    <attributes/>
    <GUI><xloc>640</xloc><yloc>256</yloc><draw>Y</draw></GUI>
  </transform>

  <transform>
    <name>Padronizar tipos</name>
    <type>SelectValues</type>
    <description>Converte tipos para o schema da silver.comentarios e remove campos auxiliares.</description>
    <distribute>Y</distribute>
    <copies>1</copies>
    <partitioning><method>none</method><schema_name/></partitioning>
    <fields>
      <select_unspecified>Y</select_unspecified>
      <remove>
        <name>titulo_ref</name>
      </remove>
      <remove>
        <name>regra_violada</name>
      </remove>
      <meta>
        <name>usuario_id</name>
        <rename>usuario_id</rename>
        <type>Integer</type>
        <length>-1</length>
        <precision>-1</precision>
      </meta>
      <meta>
        <name>conteudo_id</name>
        <rename>conteudo_id</rename>
        <type>Integer</type>
        <length>-1</length>
        <precision>-1</precision>
      </meta>
      <meta>
        <name>avaliacao</name>
        <rename>avaliacao</rename>
        <type>Integer</type>
        <length>-1</length>
        <precision>-1</precision>
      </meta>
      <meta>
        <name>data</name>
        <rename>data</rename>
        <type>Date</type>
        <conversion_mask>yyyy-MM-dd</conversion_mask>
        <length>-1</length>
        <precision>-1</precision>
      </meta>
    </fields>
    <attributes/>
    <GUI><xloc>816</xloc><yloc>96</yloc><draw>Y</draw></GUI>
  </transform>

  <transform>
    <name>Gravar silver.comentarios</name>
    <type>TableOutput</type>
    <description/>
    <distribute>Y</distribute>
    <copies>1</copies>
    <partitioning><method>none</method><schema_name/></partitioning>
    <connection>pg_desafio2</connection>
    <schema>silver</schema>
    <table>comentarios</table>
    <commit>1000</commit>
    <truncate>N</truncate>
    <ignore_errors>N</ignore_errors>
    <use_batch>Y</use_batch>
    <specify_fields>N</specify_fields>
    <fields></fields>
    <attributes/>
    <GUI><xloc>992</xloc><yloc>96</yloc><draw>Y</draw></GUI>
  </transform>

  <transform>
    <name>Preparar quarentena</name>
    <type>ScriptValueMod</type>
    <description>Acrescenta origem, mensagem_erro e data_erro para o registro rejeitado, via Javascript (substituindo plugin UserDefinedJavaExpression faltante). data_erro construido como java.sql.Timestamp para evitar ClassCastException com NativeDate.</description>
    <distribute>Y</distribute>
    <copies>1</copies>
    <partitioning><method>none</method><schema_name/></partitioning>
    <jsScripts>
      <jsScript>
        <jsScript_type>0</jsScript_type>
        <jsScript_name>Script 1</jsScript_name>
        <jsScript_script>
var origem = "comentarios";
var mensagem_erro = "Falha de validacao na Silver: " + (regra_violada != null ? regra_violada : "Erro desconhecido");
var data_erro = new java.sql.Timestamp(java.lang.System.currentTimeMillis());
        </jsScript_script>
      </jsScript>
    </jsScripts>
    <fields>
      <field>
        <name>origem</name>
        <rename>origem</rename>
        <type>String</type>
        <length>-1</length>
        <precision>-1</precision>
        <replace>N</replace>
      </field>
      <field>
        <name>mensagem_erro</name>
        <rename>mensagem_erro</rename>
        <type>String</type>
        <length>-1</length>
        <precision>-1</precision>
        <replace>N</replace>
      </field>
      <field>
        <name>data_erro</name>
        <rename>data_erro</rename>
        <type>Timestamp</type>
        <length>-1</length>
        <precision>-1</precision>
        <replace>N</replace>
      </field>
    </fields>
    <optimizationLevel>9</optimizationLevel>
    <languageVersion>ES6</languageVersion>
    <attributes/>
    <GUI><xloc>816</xloc><yloc>320</yloc><draw>Y</draw></GUI>
  </transform>

  <transform>
    <name>Selecionar campos quarentena</name>
    <type>SelectValues</type>
    <description>Mantem so as colunas que existem em quarentena.comentarios.</description>
    <distribute>Y</distribute>
    <copies>1</copies>
    <partitioning><method>none</method><schema_name/></partitioning>
    <fields>
      <field><name>origem</name></field>
      <field><name>regra_violada</name></field>
      <field><name>data_erro</name></field>
      <field><name>mensagem_erro</name></field>
      <field><name>execucao_id</name></field>
    </fields>
    <attributes/>
    <GUI><xloc>992</xloc><yloc>320</yloc><draw>Y</draw></GUI>
  </transform>

  <transform>
    <name>Gravar quarentena.comentarios</name>
    <type>TableOutput</type>
    <description/>
    <distribute>Y</distribute>
    <copies>1</copies>
    <partitioning><method>none</method><schema_name/></partitioning>
    <connection>pg_desafio2</connection>
    <schema>quarentena</schema>
    <table>comentarios</table>
    <commit>100</commit>
    <truncate>N</truncate>
    <ignore_errors>N</ignore_errors>
    <use_batch>Y</use_batch>
    <specify_fields>N</specify_fields>
    <fields></fields>
    <attributes/>
    <GUI><xloc>1168</xloc><yloc>320</yloc><draw>Y</draw></GUI>
  </transform>

  <transform_error_handling></transform_error_handling>
  <attributes/>
</pipeline>
